      "locked": false,
      "customData": null,
      "text": "LATER \u2014 REALITY CHECK\n\nOne CUDA / OpenCL / NPU backend\nCompare transfer + launch semantics\nOptional board / driver / MLIR\nOnly after the core proof pack",
